OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny fog patches slowly clearing
OL,6,Fto leave a bright and largely sunny
OL,7,Fday. The odd shower is possible along
OL,8,Fthe coast where it will be
OL,9,Fparticularly breezy. Feeling chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cold but dry night with
OL,12,Fextensive clear spells allowing a
OL,13,Ffrost to form, particularly in rural
OL,14,Flocations. Coastal spots could still
OL,15,Fsee the odd shower through the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FFine, but cold on Friday with
OL,18,Fsunny spells and winds easing. Cloud
OL,19,Fbuilding overnight, however some
OL,20,Fpatchy frost is still possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
